The legal texts are the Constitution of Maryland and the Criminal Law, Real Property, and Corporations and Associations Articles of the Maryland Code, as published by the Maryland General Assembly (mgaleg.maryland.gov). Statutes and constitutions are
not copyrightable subject matter (Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, 2020); only the law text is taken, never annotations, notes
or editorial material. The site states no reuse terms and publishes no robots.txt.
Source: the Maryland General Assembly, mgaleg.maryland.gov.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be reused under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This
repository is not legal advice and not an official publication.
